Setting one key leaves the other frontmatter keys and the markdown body byte-for-byte intact.

-- fixtures/cwd/plan.md --
---
status: draft
title: Probe plan
sp: 0
---

Body paragraph one.

Second paragraph.
-- cmd --
booping frontmatter-update plan.md owner=ada
-- stdout --
--- plan.md
+++ plan.md
@@ -2,6 +2,7 @@
 status: draft
 title: Probe plan
 sp: 0
+owner: ada
 ---
 
 Body paragraph one.
-- stderr --
updated plan.md: owner=ada
-- expected/cwd/plan.md --
---
status: draft
title: Probe plan
sp: 0
owner: ada
---

Body paragraph one.

Second paragraph.
-- exit --
0
